<title>BELGIUM: Ericsson signs contract with EU.</title>
<headline>Ericsson signs contract with EU.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecommunications group Telefon AB L.M. Ericsson said it had signed a contract with the European Parliament covering the installation of 20,000 telecommunication lines in the cities of Brussels, Strasbourg and Luxembourg.</p>
<p>The installations of the 20,000 Consono MD110 lines will be spread over 1996 and 1997, it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
